	 Out: file$ = name of the file selected
	      fileNumber >= 3 if file$ successfully opened

	See: XstFileSelectSetInfo(), XstFileSelectGetInfo,
	     CLOSE(), OPEN(), EOF(), POF(), LOF(), SEEK()

